{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish Play is a creative game that lets you design your own personal aquarium.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/c49aa4a0bc1f77676ec613f37b9e56c4.poster.avif?t=1764644598\" width=670 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/c49aa4a0bc1f77676ec613f37b9e56c4.webm?t=1764644598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/c49aa4a0bc1f77676ec613f37b9e56c4.mp4?t=1764644598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Choose Your Aquarium</strong><br>Select one of 20 different aquariums to start building your own. The aquariums come in various shapes such as square, rectangle, circle, and cylinder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/43ebebd3567a235fa9601458286fa6b4.poster.avif?t=1764644598\" width=478 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/43ebebd3567a235fa9601458286fa6b4.webm?t=1764644598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/43ebebd3567a235fa9601458286fa6b4.mp4?t=1764644598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Real-Life Fish Variety</strong><br>Browse through a shop offering over 240 species of real-world fish. Add your favorite ones to your tank and enjoy watching them swim around. From small and cute fish like tetras and guppies to majestic species like the arowana, there's something for every aquascaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/cc1ad635ddff6a74b66449ed5aebc442.poster.avif?t=1764644598\" width=478 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/cc1ad635ddff6a74b66449ed5aebc442.webm?t=1764644598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/cc1ad635ddff6a74b66449ed5aebc442.mp4?t=1764644598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Decorate Your Unique Aquarium</strong><br>Does your aquarium feel too empty with just fish? Don\u2019t worry! The shop features around 400 different decorative items. From aquatic plants for hiding to themed decorations for style, mix and match to create a uniquely designed aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Additional Custom Features</strong><br>Change the terrain inside the tank or adjust the background color to make your aquarium even more distinct and personal.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852930?t=1764644598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852930?t=1764644598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/f7b2266d7bcf8af60fc6f693e22a9468b211dc9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764644598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/f7b2266d7bcf8af60fc6f693e22a9468b211dc9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764644598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish Play is a creative game that lets you design your own personal aquarium.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/c49aa4a0bc1f77676ec613f37b9e56c4.poster.avif?t=1764644598\" width=670 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/c49aa4a0bc1f77676ec613f37b9e56c4.webm?t=1764644598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/c49aa4a0bc1f77676ec613f37b9e56c4.mp4?t=1764644598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Choose Your Aquarium</strong><br>Select one of 20 different aquariums to start building your own. The aquariums come in various shapes such as square, rectangle, circle, and cylinder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/43ebebd3567a235fa9601458286fa6b4.poster.avif?t=1764644598\" width=478 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/43ebebd3567a235fa9601458286fa6b4.webm?t=1764644598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/43ebebd3567a235fa9601458286fa6b4.mp4?t=1764644598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Real-Life Fish Variety</strong><br>Browse through a shop offering over 240 species of real-world fish. Add your favorite ones to your tank and enjoy watching them swim around. From small and cute fish like tetras and guppies to majestic species like the arowana, there's something for every aquascaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/cc1ad635ddff6a74b66449ed5aebc442.poster.avif?t=1764644598\" width=478 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/cc1ad635ddff6a74b66449ed5aebc442.webm?t=1764644598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/extras/cc1ad635ddff6a74b66449ed5aebc442.mp4?t=1764644598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Decorate Your Unique Aquarium</strong><br>Does your aquarium feel too empty with just fish? Don\u2019t worry! The shop features around 400 different decorative items. From aquatic plants for hiding to themed decorations for style, mix and match to create a uniquely designed aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Additional Custom Features</strong><br>Change the terrain inside the tank or adjust the background color to make your aquarium even more distinct and personal.</p>","developers":["Ligensoft Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852930/a0217d3d27a4bed7a073df8330e7c5eec5ceb3ec/header.jpg?t=1764644598","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3852930/510300898/3fe9a96340556f9da9fd4b0936a81d9a4a59bda0/1764307870/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764644597","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3852930/510300898/3fe9a96340556f9da9fd4b0936a81d9a4a59bda0/1764307